# Copied verbatim from the team's mycobot_320pi_R6A repo (mycobot_description
# has ~130MB of mesh files) then hand-modified in 3 files. Those 3 modified
# files are tracked separately under overrides/ instead of duplicating the
# whole tree here. See docs/PIPELINE.md (or the HTML/docx docs) for the exact
# copy + override steps to reconstruct this directory.
src/mycobot_R6A/

# The 5 rosetta/lerobot-bridge repos are cloned via `vcs import src <
# src/rosetta.repos` (see that file) -- pinned upstream code, not ours to
# track. Re-clone with vcstool instead of committing it here.
src/action/

# Runtime/build state -- lives inside the Docker container's own filesystem
# layer (only src/ is bind-mounted from the host per docker/run.sh), so none
# of this should ever actually appear on the host, but excluded defensively.
build/
install/
log/
venv_lerobot/
datasets/

# Safety-net copy of the container's own datasets/bags/contracts, pulled
# out via docker cp while recreating the container after the directory
# rename (try_gazebo -> Gazebo_to_LeRobot_Pipeline) broke its bind mount.
# Same content as datasets/ above, not source.
container_backup/

# Personal screen recordings dropped in this folder during the session --
# not part of the pipeline.
*.mp4

# Editor/OS noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
